---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Open Urban Data catalogue';
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <article class="project-detail">
    <div class="project-detail-hero">
      <div class="project-detail-copy">
        <p class="project-summary">
          Open Urban Data is a catalogue of data sources useful for urban analysis in Russia.
        </p>
        <p class="project-summary">
          <a href="https://openurbandata.ru/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Visit the Open Urban Data catalogue (in Russian only)
          </a>
        </p>
        <div class="project-facts">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-richtext">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        The catalogue was created by a team of 9 urban researchers and planners (including me) and compiles over 200 data sources that can be highly useful for analyses. My contribution was adding, describing and classifying a part of the sources (mostly global spatial datasets).
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
